Third-party test fixtures

The frozen HTML files under
Packages/SwiftReadability/Tests/SwiftReadabilityTests/Fixtures/ are captures of
third-party web pages, used only as test inputs. They are NOT covered by the
MIT licence above and are NOT shipped in the application binary — they are
resources of the test target only.

Each capture keeps the licence of its source, recorded with its URL and capture
date in that directory's PROVENANCE.md. Sources are Wikimedia projects
(CC BY-SA), MDN (CC BY-SA 2.5), GNU (CC BY-ND), W3C, the IETF, Project
Gutenberg (public domain), the Apache Software Foundation, and the Python
Software Foundation.
